WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.374 --> 00:00:03.291
Unit fourteen. Tobacco and Vaping!

2
00:00:04.241 --> 00:00:08.007
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.057 --> 00:00:11.253
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.303 --> 00:00:15.104
Today we learn about Tobacco and Vaping. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:19.403
Tobacco. Say it with me. Tobacco!

6
00:00:22.894 --> 00:00:26.344
Vaping. Say it with me. Vaping!

7
00:00:29.854 --> 00:00:33.687
E-cigarette. Say it with me. E-cigarette!

8
00:00:37.184 --> 00:00:40.867
Nicotine. Say it with me. Nicotine!

9
00:00:44.353 --> 00:00:48.070
Addiction. Say it with me. Addiction!

10
00:00:51.578 --> 00:00:55.061
Lungs. Say it with me. Lungs!

11
00:00:58.589 --> 00:01:02.639
Advertising. Say it with me. Advertising!

12
00:01:06.106 --> 00:01:09.656
Refuse. Say it with me. Refuse!

13
00:01:13.169 --> 00:01:25.071
Tobacco and vaping both deliver nicotine, which causes addiction. An e-cigarette can still harm the lungs and brain. Advertising tries to make them look cool, but I can refuse.

14
00:01:25.121 --> 00:01:26.510
I can do that too!

15
00:01:27.793 --> 00:01:32.944
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:32.994 --> 00:01:34.144
E-cigarette!

17
00:01:35.161 --> 00:01:40.451
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:40.501 --> 00:01:41.701
Advertising!

19
00:01:42.726 --> 00:01:49.321
Did you know? Nicotine is highly addictive, and teenage brains are especially sensitive to it!

20
00:01:49.371 --> 00:01:51.200
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:51.891 --> 00:02:00.260
Think and answer. Why do companies target young people with advertising?

22
00:02:00.310 --> 00:02:01.460
Great answer!

23
00:02:02.728 --> 00:02:08.506
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:08.556 --> 00:02:11.520
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

